  "content": "\n\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 全面翻新的世界生成 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes o' Plenty</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic)</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 完全最佳化並支援光影</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 自訂&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影預設集</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 新增頭目與生物 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends &amp; Foes</a>)</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 數百個全新迷宮與結構 (</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Voyager Structures</a></span><strong>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures)</a></strong></h5>\n<h5>✔️ 便利性功能，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones</a>&nbsp;與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XP Storage</a></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️</strong> **包含來自 1.21.2+ 的內容 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>)</h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a>&nbsp;搭配&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeroplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Features</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 眾多自訂功能以提升遊玩體驗</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ 內建 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Free World Sharing</a></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f57903%252fbetter-mc-fabric-bmc3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">330+ 模組</a></strong></h5>\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/71yfq8avpc4\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yEDj3QS45X4\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aJSOHjG6Jew\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准或認可。</strong></span></h5>",
